        ["1"] = <"Derived from: Examination of middle ear, Draft archetype [Internet]. Australian Digital Health Agency (NEHTA), ADHA Clinical Knowledge Manager. Authored: 2015 Jun 08. Available at: http://dcm.nehta.org.au/ckm#showArchetype_1013.1.1255 (discontinued).">
